WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.050
- Tiger King, Joe Exotic's
22-year prison sentence

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.810
for trying to kill Carole Baskin

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:05.780
is being vacated,

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.240
but don't worry he is
not getting out of jail.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.980
Basically, the trial
court said that Joe Exotic

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.360
had two different plans
to kill Carole Baskin.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.350
And as a result in his sentencing,
he got a higher sentence

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:16.183
than he should have

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.150
because the 10th circuit said that

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.540
you can't kill someone more than once

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.370
and all of this was part of the same plan

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.550
to kill Carole Baskin
so the amount of time

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.840
that he was actually sentenced
should be slightly less.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.100
So he was sentenced to 22 years in jail,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.270
that might be reduced to about
17 years in jail instead.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:33.240
So Joe Exotic is not going
free, he'll be re-sentenced

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.153
so we will see him in court.

